# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Stitchy London — PUBLIC delivery repo (GitHub + jsDelivr CDN)
#
# Allowlist model: ignore EVERYTHING, then re-include ONLY the files
# Webflow loads over jsDelivr. Anything new (stickers, HTML, docs,
# build tooling, internal notes) is ignored by default and can never
# ship by accident. Internal docs (CLAUDE.md, handover/, memory/,
# build/, .claude/, etc.) are all covered by the catch-all below.
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# 1 — Ignore everything
/*

# 2 — Keep this ignore file
!/.gitignore

# (optional) Webflow custom-code source doc — uncomment to keep in-repo
# !/WEBFLOW_CDN_LINKS.md

# 3 — Descend into assets/, ignore its contents by default
!/assets/
/assets/*

# 4 — Served CSS (style.css is the local build source → stays ignored)
!/assets/css/
/assets/css/*
!/assets/css/global.css
!/assets/css/bd-animations.css
!/assets/css/bd-cursor.css

# 5 — All JS is delivery code (incl. site-loader.js, being recoded) → ship the folder
!/assets/js/

# 6 — Served image: the cursor sprite (fetched + injected by bd-cursor.js)
!/assets/images/
/assets/images/*
!/assets/images/cursors/
/assets/images/cursors/*
!/assets/images/cursors/cursor-sprite.svg

# (optional) Webflow header/footer custom-code source — uncomment to keep in-repo
# !/templates/
# /templates/*
# !/templates/webflow-header-code.html
# !/templates/webflow-footer-code.html

# 7 — Belt-and-braces: never ship OS/editor cruft from allowlisted folders
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db
